{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16111","headline":"赠郭将军 · 王建","name":"赠郭将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"承恩新拜上将军，当直巡更近五云。\n天下表章经院过，宫中语笑隔墙闻。\n密封计策非时奏，别赐衣裳到处薰。\n向晚临堦看号簿，眼前风景任支分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}